<title>INDONESIA: Modern Photo 1996 net slightly up.</title>
<headline>Modern Photo 1996 net slightly up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 1996</p>
<p>				    (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			 63.54	vs     62.0</p>
<p>    Net sales			 666.2	 vs    642.3</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rupiah)  476	  vs     465</p>
<p>    Gross profit		    174.60     vs    173.67</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 95.24     vs     90.27</p>
<p>    Profit before income tax     90.70     vs     88.72</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	     166.67     vs    143.14</p>
<p>NOTE : The results were audited. PT Modern Photo, a member of the Modern Group, is involved in the sale and distribution of photographic material and printing equipment.</p>
</text>
